+# `sglang is using nccl==...` and its custom-all-reduce success line after
+# initialization — `All Reduce config: ...` for CustomAllReduceV2 (full NVLink),
+# or `Registering N cuda graph addresses` for the V1 CustomAllreduce that every
+# PCIe rig actually runs (V2 is NVLink-gated; V1 is silent until CUDA-graph
